<title>Saylo 1.4.1</title>
<h1>Saylo 1.4.1</h1>
<pre style="font: 13px -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap">Signed and notarized build of the notch release.

- Dictation opens out of the notch, with the stop button beside the camera housing. On displays without a notch it drops from the top edge.
- Permissions are kept across updates, and Saylo names the permission that is missing when you press the shortcut.
- Fixed races when changing languages while Saylo was still starting up.</pre>
]]></description>
