            <description><![CDATA[<!DOCTYPE html>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Saylo 1.4.0</title>
<h1>Saylo 1.4.0</h1>
<pre style="font: 13px -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap">Dictation now opens out of the notch.

- The listening HUD grows from the notch at the top of the screen, with the stop button beside the camera housing. On displays without a notch it drops from the top edge.
- Permission handling is more reliable: Saylo names the permission that is missing when you press the shortcut, picks up a permission you just granted right away, and recovers the shortcut if macOS drops it.
- Fixed races when changing languages while Saylo was still starting up.
- Updated Sparkle to 2.10.1.</pre>
]]></description>
